# Auto-deploy for 3CHORDS.DEV. Runs as you, not root: add it with `crontab -e`.
# Change the path to wherever the checkout lives.
#   flock   skips a run if the previous one is still going
#   Every 10 minutes is a trade: a merge or release goes live at most that long
#   after CI finishes. An idle run is one small registry request per environment.
#   logger  sends the output to the system log: journalctl -t 3chords-update
*/10 * * * * flock -n /tmp/3chords-update.lock "$HOME/3Chords.dev/deploy/update.sh" 2>&1 | logger -t 3chords-update
